flowchart TB
  A[Hit ratio dropped] --> B{Prefix above minimum?}
  B -- no --> B1[Pad or merge to reach it]
  B -- yes --> C{First difference early?}
  C -- yes --> C1[Move dynamic text last]
  C -- no --> D{Over 15 rpm per key?}
  D -- yes --> D1[Shard across stable keys]
  D -- no --> E{Gaps longer than lifetime?}
  E -- yes --> E1[Longer TTL or prewarm]
  E -- no --> F[Check tools, effort, compaction]
